SUMMARY:Alaska Ultimate High Adventure – Week 1
LOCATION:Great Alaska Council Service Center\, Anchorage\, Alaska
DESCRIPTION:Great Alaska Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/610-UHA
 \n\n\n\nHave you always wanted to hike on a glacier? Or raft the rapids i
